Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}视野一片零。机体无法控制。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这种地方运送物资什么的，太乱来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去会坠毁的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，在这种地方根本没有能着陆的地方……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Mr.心园）怎么会这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝉丸和克拉肯前辈竟然都被那些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给干掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔咔咔，不用在意啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，只要有我们害虫兄弟在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就没问题啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.97,0:00:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马和凌牙也让人在意，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有快斗消失了这件事……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也很在意呢。正好。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我最讨厌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.29,0:00:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨大的怪兽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了，蚊忍者。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)好嘞 今天心园市也是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪儿都没异常啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.34,0:01:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了 太好了。 万事大吉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})游马 你打算
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直这样巡逻下去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然 巴利安的家伙们肯定还会再出现的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.65,0:01:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.60,0:01:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算没有星光体 也没关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.81,0:01:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((星光体：再见了 游马))
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 你在说什么啊。有你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了 我可是如虎添翼啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)说到底 游马君
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算是重新振作起来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.95,0:01:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)我想相信是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)可是……。(德之助)有了 乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)游马 游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.91,0:01:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助 大家……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.46,0:01:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好了乌拉！ 准备好了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)笨蛋 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.85,0:02:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)啊哈哈哈哈……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说 准备好了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.97,0:02:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}准备？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样乌拉 这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我做的 星光体之墓乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}附近的废品堆放场里有漂亮的玻璃{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.52,0:02:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我捡回来 做了这个乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}墓什么的 你打算做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说乌拉。 星光体的葬礼乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等 等一下啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}葬礼很重要的乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能让活着的人整理心情乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你这混蛋 德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我适可而止吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你有考虑过游马的心情吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.05,0:02:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:03:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是啊乌拉 我也很伤心啊乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是 我们虽然不像游马那样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能和星光体说上话乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.12,0:03:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 星光体是我的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我们的同伴啊乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都被星光体帮助过乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是没有星光体 就没法和大家……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没法和大家成为同伴了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是 我也……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.77,0:03:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是这样。大家都是被星光体救过的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以这场葬礼是为了我自己办的乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算只有我一个人也要办乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，奶奶说吃晚饭了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿，今天的决斗状态超好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真少见。嘿嘿，随你怎么说。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎么说就在那个时候啊，星光体…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.60,0:04:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…不，那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然这张卡不能少！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((是啊，游马))
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.31,0:04:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[无线]({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})怎么样了？游马的情况。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马作为决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经拥有了一流的实力。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral把游马培养得非常出色。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但如今失去了Astral
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他失去了自信。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.69,0:04:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})那家伙，能重新振作起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:05:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道。但如果是游马的话，一定会的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)看来我们的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有搞错。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})不愧是海斗。多亏了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你真的打算去吗？克里斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。这个实验极其危险。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不能让游马知道这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊哈啊 哈啊哈啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～ 一切正常！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好好！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天心园也是安全的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安那帮家伙是被本大爷吓到了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 那种说法。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.11,0:07:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们！ 又跟过来了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.56,0:07:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉… 因为担心游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}担心我什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是因为你还没有接受{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体已经不在了这件事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 明明好好地…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 自己没注意到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什… 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然没注意到呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.55,0:07:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每天巡逻的这个地点。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:08:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 每一个地方 都是你和星光体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起用决斗战斗过的回忆之地。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.42,0:08:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会… 才不是那样！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.91,0:08:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个地方也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.09,0:08:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是星光体的坟墓所在的地方啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})没错 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为自己已经能够接受
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体不在了这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但不是的。你无意识中一直
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.07,0:08:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在追寻着星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你相信只要走访这些回忆之地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天能再见到星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:08:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游……游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错……就是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不相信。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……Astral死了什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.11,0:09:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能相信啊！》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((要赢))
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.77,0:09:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……喂 会感冒的哦 游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别管我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral绝对还活着。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.11,0:09:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙怎么可能会死不可能。所以……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:10:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要一直寻找那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到找到那家伙为止都要找！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)我一直在等这句话。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.07,0:10:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 站起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快……快斗 你……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.65,0:10:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去？到底要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这还用问。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去把阿斯特拉尔夺回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.07,0:10:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.28,0:10:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把阿斯特拉尔夺回来……？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.39,0:10:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(引擎声)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.38,0:10:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解释之后再说。出发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那阿斯特拉尔还活着吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.44,0:10:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去把这件事弄清楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弄清楚？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们战斗的最终目的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终目的……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.47,0:10:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗。关于纽梅隆代码的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纽梅隆……代码？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((这张卡拥有决定所有世界命运的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.75,0:11:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力量))
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)恐怕阿斯特拉尔的使命是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到那张卡毁灭巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但如果没有阿斯特拉尔{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就没办法找到 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.73,0:11:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管我们怎么战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.57,0:11:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要巴利安的猛攻继续下去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟早会落到他们手里。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦变成那样，No.卡就会被
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们改写{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.49,0:11:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔世界也好这个世界也好，都会毁灭吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要阻止这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论如何都需要阿斯特拉尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你消沉的这段时间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和V找到了去阿斯特拉尔世界的方法。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去阿斯特拉尔世界！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 要怎么做…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}线索就在这枚硬币上。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎… 咦!? 那个是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在遗迹里找到的老爸的硬币…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.17,0:12:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么 为什么你… 啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.42,0:12:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃 1 2 3…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少了一枚。 你这家伙 到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 别大惊小怪的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是借了一点而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。(凯特)比起那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这枚硬币里藏着了不得了的秘密。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(虫鸣声)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.39,0:12:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 凯特。不…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.12,0:12:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈——啾!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.45,0:12:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什… 什么啊 那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)那是我和V一起完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是时空移动装置。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时空移动装置？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)凯特大人欢迎回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星界的异次元飞行船
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能够感知到遗迹的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，为什么它能做到呢。哈啾！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我推测你老爸留在遗迹里的硬币{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:13:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是不是藏着什么秘密，于是调查了一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸的硬币？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果发现，硬币的真身{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.12,0:13:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是来自星界世界的物质星辉石。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星辉石？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是星辉石。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是我们这个世界所没有的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}庞大能量的结晶。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利用那玩意儿撬开通往异世界的大门{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你送到星光界去。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好……好厉害……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你居然做了这种东西啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.39,0:13:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么把游马带到这里来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.85,0:13:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)我和你可不一样，可没打算
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.79,0:13:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}惯着这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是这个问题。是要强行打开时空之门啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}门的那一头究竟是什么情况，根本不知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.06,0:13:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事我早就知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V 为什么不告诉我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明摆着的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是告诉了你，你就会因为你肯定会说绝对要去。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:13:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定能把星光界夺回来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你根本不明白这个实验有多危险。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}万一就算能去到星光界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里也是完全未知的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会发生什么谁也不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最坏的情况，可能就回不来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那……那种事无所谓！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.22,0:14:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我只是……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.39,0:14:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克里斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的父亲把硬币留在遗迹里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}肯定不是偶然。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果这一切事态
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他全都预见到了的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那7枚硬币就是给游马的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是叫我们去星光界的信息。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.39,0:14:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话 果然
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就说明星光还活着对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错… 星光还活着。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对还活着！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((在找到那家伙之前 我会一直找下去！！))
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.74,0:14:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)我也拜托您了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:14:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能找回星光的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有游马。 所以…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 V。 让我去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马上去做出发的准备吧 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)听好了？ 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通往星光界的门
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.49,0:15:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我现在就把它撬开 把你送进去。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.05,0:15:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那扇门能撑到什么时候 我不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果它关上了就无法保证你能回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。小鸟，别担心！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会把星光体带回来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，轨道！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)将设置于装置中的星光体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}施加电压使其释放能量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.51,0:15:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那份能量充电
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再一口气释放出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.50,0:15:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以此打开通往星光界的门。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！在充电完成之前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不要从那个地方动。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.69,0:15:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从星光体抽取能量仅限一次…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说打开门的机会只有一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。能量填充 40%。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.51,0:16:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)45 50 55…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.19,0:16:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.19,0:16:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么？停电了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！偏偏在这种时候……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.01,0:16:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去，电力一旦停止，作战就会失败。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥比塔尔！用你这家伙的能量。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？用俺的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了，奥比塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.01,0:16:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵…遵命。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……那么，俺这就动手了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}噼哩一下！呱嗷——！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥比塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，装置的紧急电源就确保了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔咔咔咔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 VS 快斗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.45,0:16:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然想去星光世界……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.56,0:16:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷可不允许！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！屏障……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，这次停电也是你干的好事吗。咔咔咔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 巴利安…… 你这家伙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.49,0:17:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）别动 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.01,0:17:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用轨道电梯的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}充电 还需要 时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.06,0:17:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里 由我来守护！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）说得对直到他出发为止……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们 绝不会让他们碰他一根手指！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V…… 快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.39,0:17:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔咔咔！ 有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.74,0:17:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就 如你所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你们开始打倒好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个场地里我的生命值会翻倍{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的生命值则减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}handicap duel吗。也好。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我最讨厌 大块头了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.33,0:17:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尤其是像你们这样操纵巨大怪兽的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:18:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗者啊～ 呸。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)这就是你的真面目吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V 接住这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用它吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.66,0:18:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你的心意 我确实收到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.65,0:18:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 没想到竟然会像这样和你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行决斗的日子居然会到来。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可别拖我后腿啊 克里斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真敢说啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.49,0:18:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为是谁教了你决斗的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弟子总有一天会超越师父。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.35,0:18:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 就让我见识一下吧。那份力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗模式 光子变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.25,0:18:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}规则是战斗皇家决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我做好觉悟是吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(3人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.58,0:18:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:19:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤深邃空间巡洋舰九号。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽可以通过从手牌将机械族怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送入墓地来特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全息投影。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.35,0:19:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择场上1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.49,0:19:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成相同的等级 攻击力 守备力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.15,0:19:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放置到怪兽区域。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.01,0:19:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择深邃空间巡洋舰九号{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.51,0:19:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将全息投影
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到场上。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！等级9有2只！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级9的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深空巡洋舰·九号与{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全息投影进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.19,0:19:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.27,0:19:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.9。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我所背负的命运啊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.87,0:19:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此刻正是吞噬银河
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化作巨大大地降临之时。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.87,0:19:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天盖星 戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.01,0:19:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这怪兽也太特么大了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗皇家战斗中，各玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首个回合不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.05,0:20:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我到此回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.17,0:20:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.39,0:20:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤光子斩击者。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.99,0:20:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当场上没有怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 我要通常召唤光子充能者。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.85,0:20:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 1回合1次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.89,0:20:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到下次自己的回合可以让攻击力变成2倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将攻击力2000以上的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤这只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光之化身 在此降临。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.87,0:20:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)我就这样 结束回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么快就出现了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.23,0:20:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超银河眼 银河。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来吗！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 军刀鲨 血之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.55,0:20:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.16,0:21:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组把新的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.35,0:21:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}军队蚊 血之力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加入手牌是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.67,0:21:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蚊学忍法·军队蚊行进！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.87,0:21:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌中带有军队蚊之名的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.44,0:21:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2只怪兽特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧新的血之力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.85,0:21:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级2的有3只！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也要来吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级2的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}军队蚊 血之力量3只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.84,0:21:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.34,0:21:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.2！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.22,0:21:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 掠过夜之寂静的影子。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.19,0:21:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蚊学忍者 影蚊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.56,0:21:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力是零？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 怪兽在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的怪兽看不见啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.51,0:21:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.57,0:22:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有的 我的怪兽确实存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.04,0:22:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下 不是只有巨大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.49,0:22:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才叫力量。 咔！

